<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE topic
  PUBLIC "-//OASIS//DTD DITA Topic//EN" "topic.dtd">
<topic id="Toc6861">
      <title>关闭实例</title>
      <body>
        <table colsep="1" frame="all" rowsep="1">
          <tgroup cols="2">
            <colspec colname="col1" colnum="1" colwidth="1.1*"/>
            <colspec colname="col2" colnum="2" colwidth="0.9*"/>
            <thead>
              <row>
                <entry>命令</entry>
                <entry>响应</entry>
              </row>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
              <row>
                <entry>AT+HTTPCLOSE=&lt;id&gt;</entry>
                <entry>
                  <div>OK</div>
                  <div>或ERROR</div>
                </entry>
              </row>
            </tbody>
          </tgroup>
        </table>
        <p>命令说明：</p>
        <p>该命令关闭 HTTP
实例，目前仅支持一个实例，因此下次创建时必现删除上一个实例。</p>
        <p>参数描述:</p>
        <p>
&lt;id&gt;：由AT+HTTPCREATE命令创建的客户端实例。</p>
        <p>典型示例:</p>
        <table colsep="1" frame="all" rowsep="1">
          <tgroup cols="1">
            <colspec colname="col1" colnum="1" colwidth="1*"/>
            <tbody>
              <row>
                <entry>
                  <p>AT+HTTPCLOSE=0</p>
                  <p>OK</p>
                </entry>
              </row>
            </tbody>
         
          </tgroup>
        </table>
      </body>
    </topic>
